  "final_answer": "I have all the information needed. Here is the complete answer:\n\n## 🍫 Easy Microwave Chocolate Cake (Allrecipes)\n\n**Recipe URL:** https://www.allrecipes.com/easy-microwave-chocolate-cake-recipe-7681938\n\n### ✅ Criteria Verification\n- **Prep Time:** 5 minutes (less than 30 minutes ✓)\n- **Contains Chocolate:** Yes — 2 tablespoons cocoa powder ✓\n- **User Rating:** 4.2 stars (240 ratings, 202 reviews) ✓ — exceeds the 4-star minimum\n- **Additional Info:** Cook time 2 mins • Total time 7 mins • Yields 2 servings • Category: Dessert • Cuisine: American\n\n### 📝 Ingredients\n1. Nonstick cooking spray\n2. ¼ cup white sugar\n3. ¼ cup milk\n4. 1 large egg\n5. 3 tablespoons butter, softened\n6. 1 teaspoon vanilla extract\n7. ½ cup all-purpose flour\n8. 2 tablespoons cocoa powder\n9. ¼ teaspoon baking powder\n10. 1 pinch salt\n\n### 👨‍🍳 Step-by-Step Instructions\n\n**Step 1:** Spray a medium microwave-safe bowl with nonstick cooking spray; set aside.\n\n**Step 2:** Combine sugar, milk, egg, butter, and vanilla in a mixing bowl; mix well. Combine flour, cocoa powder, baking powder, and salt in a separate bowl. Blend flour mixture into milk mixture until smooth. Pour into the prepared microwave-safe bowl.\n\n**Step 3:** Cover and cook in the microwave on high until cake springs back when touched, 2 to 2½ minutes. Allow cake to cool for 5 minutes, then cover the bowl with a plate and invert cake onto the plate.\n\n### 🍽️ Nutrition (per serving)\n- Calories: 433\n- Fat: 21g\n- Carbs: 54g\n- Protein: 9g\n\nThis recipe by Carrie was a perfect match — a quick chocolate dessert that takes only 5 minutes of prep time and is highly rated by home cooks!",
